"""
Resident Evil 7: 21 Game Plugin v3.0.1 for exteraGram
Authors: @Nondiat x Lutiy vibecode

Implements the high-stakes "21" Blackjack mini-game from Resident Evil 7 DLC.
v3.0.1 Major Release Updates:
- Double Bust Victory Condition (Lesser Bust Wins): When both players bust over target score, the player with LESS total points (closer to target) wins!
- Universal Application: Double bust lesser-win rule applies to all torture modes (Fingers, Saw, Electric) and all presets.
- Complete Bugfree Stability Milestone.
"""

